      "(15) I Know",
      "",
      "Everyone comes to the small store to buy things. Leng Xiaoxi wants to buy fruit tea.",
      "She sees that everyone is using their student card. At school, everyone uses their student card to buy things.",
      "There is money inside the card. Leng Xiaoxi thinks, “Should I use my junior’s student card to buy fruit tea?”",
      "",
      "At that time, Gao Ming says to the person at the store, “Use my card to buy her fruit tea.”",
      "",
      "Leng Xiaoxi looks at Gao Ming. Gao Ming is also looking at her.",
      "",
      "“Gao Ming, I … I have something … I want to tell you,” Leng Xiaoxi says.",
      "",
      "Leng Xiaoxi and Gao Ming walk to the front of the small store.",
      "",
      "Leng Xiaoxi says, “Gao Ming, I … I am not a student at Xijing University now.”",
      "",
      "Gao Ming says, “I know. You are working at a hospital.”"
    ]
